  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You excel at fighting with many weapons at once, as befits your numerous limbs.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Multiweapon Fighting, three or more arms capable of wielding weapons.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You are treated as having the Two-Weapon Fighting feat for the purpose of meeting all prerequisites. In addition, whenever a feat would give you an extra attack with an off-hand weapon (such as from Improved Two-Weapon Fighting), you may make an attack with every weapon currently wielded in hands other than your primary hand.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/starfinder-to-pathfinder#toc72\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
